    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this charming and spacious four-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home with a side and rear extensions, ideally situated on the well-established Lorcan Green. Offering generous accommodation and excellent potential to create a wonderful family home. This is a fantastic opportunity for buyers looking to refurbish and personalise a substantial property in a mature and popular residential location.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, a bright, welcoming hallway with carpet flooring and a period-style staircase sets the tone for the home. The ground floor offers excellent living space, comprising a front reception room with a feature fireplace, flowing into a bright open sitting room leading out to the kitchen. A separate kitchen, fitted with timber cabinetry, overlooks the rear garden, a large open plan dining area to the rear, while a guest bedroom with en-suite bathroom complete this level.\r\n\r\nLorcan Gree is a mature and highly convenient residential location, close to a range of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, Beaumont Hospital and parks such as Ellenfield park. The area benefits from excellent transport links, with nearby bus routes and easy access to the M1, M50, Dublin Airport, and Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal location for families, first-time buyers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb opportunity for buyers seeking generous living space across multiple levels, in a convenient, established location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer – 1.79 m x 3.87 m – A welcoming entrance hall leading leading to the living room, kitchen and guest bedroom. Featuring carpet flooring, decorative ceiling coving, and a carpeted staircase leading to the upper floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.91 m x 3.87 m – A bright and spacious open reception room with carpet flooring, an elegant feature fireplace, coved ceiling, pendant lighting and pocket doors leading to the sitting room.\r\n\r\nSitting Room – 3.42 m x 3.48 m – A bright, open dining space with carpet flooring, coved ceiling, pendant lighting and a window overlooking the rear garden flooding the room with natural light. \r\n\r\nGuest Bedroom 3.01m x 2.83m with carpet floor covering, fitted roller blinds, curtain rails and en-suite.\r\n\r\nEn-suite 2.01m x 2.83 with floor to ceiling tiling, power shower, W.C. & W.H.B..\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.28 m x 3.48 m – A bright fitted kitchen with warm wood-toned cabinetry providing excellent storage space, tile splash-back, ample countertops, integrated extractor fan, lino flooring, a window overlooking the garden and access onto the dining room.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 5.01 m x 3.00 m – A bright, open dining space to the rear of the property with lino flooring, pendant lighting and double French Doors leading onto the rear garden and a storage room.\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\nLanding 2.34m x 0.93m A carpeted landing leading to all three bedrooms and the family bathroom with fitted roller blinds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.80m x 3.10m to the rear of the property with carpet floor covering, fitted wardrobes, ceiling coving, W.H.B., fitted roller blinds and curtain rails.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom 3.45m x 4.24m with carpet floor covering, fitted wardrobes, ceiling coving, fitted roller blinds and curtain rails.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 2.32m x 3.19m with carpet floor covering, fitted wardrobes, fitted roller blinds and curtain rails.\r\n\r\nBath – 1.89 m x 1.72 m – With floor to ceiling tiling, bath tub with shower combo above, W.C. & W.H.B..\r\n\r\nTotal – 116 Sq.M / 1,249 Sq.Ft.\r\n\r\nExterior – To the front, the property presents as a semi-detached home with a brick facade, tiled roof, and twin chimneys. A paved driveway leads to the property, with a low boundary wall and rockery to the front garden. To the rear, the garden features a paved patio area leading out from the property provides additional outdoor space, excellent space for outdoor dining, relaxing and entertaining. There is a lawn space and a timber storage shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
