        "Content": "Rear extension\r\nChain free sale\r\nWest facing garden\r\nGuest bedroom with En-suite\r\nGas central heating (boiler 5yrs old)\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nFitted blinds\r\nTimber storage shed\r\nPaved area in rear garden\r\nOff-street parking\r\nKitchen extension\r\nExcellent location\r\nExcellent transport links\r\nLocal amenities nearby\r\nClose proximity to M1 and M50 motorways"
      },
